sults  here we can see a word cloud and we can  see that people actually type in a lot  of different search terms did they end  up buying because what what song  keywords does that a lot of other tools  don't do is they show you buyer intent  keywords with real data pulled directly  from Amazon right a lot of the other  tools make all these estimations and  just use Google Keyword planner I mean  it's not actually entirely relevant to  the product itself but with zon keywords  what's on keywords does is it actually  shows buyer and tank keywords so what we  can see here as we see like laser tag  toy guns gif for 10 year-old boys right  all these different terms that could  potentially actually you know have  somebody who wants to buy it like a  laser gun set which is the first part  that we looked at and so if we type in  back-handspring you know what we can see  here is there's a number of different  ways to actually do this right so we can  see gymnastic equipments for girls  gymnastic equipment for kids gymnastics  rollers we can see back handspring  trainer gymnastics springboard back  handspring trainers gymnastics barrel  smarter spot or gymnastic equipment for  home for kids a lot of different ways to  say this right relatively low search  volume but these are more expensive  products so you don't need as many  searches you don't need as much volume  right so that's kind of the thought  process that I go through  when I actually go to create these to do  my keyword research so if we do golf  pull carts the last product that we  looked at and we can take a look at some  of the keyword data for this particular  product we can see that's a little bit  more seasonal right people obviously  golf you know at different portions of  the year but relatively strong and we  can see a lot of different terms here  like golf push cart four wheels three  wheels bag umbrellas caddy  you know golf walking carts electric  golf walking carts lots of different  ways to kind of s